{"id":"bdwthbplsb4hb9iyb4rjjgcdb","title":"巨人之王？直立人或在雨林中生存","originalTitle":"Kings of the jungle? This early human had surprising survival skills that rivalled ours","summary":"研究表明，直立人可能在18万年前的中国南部雨林中生存，这挑战了之前认为直立人仅限于草原环境的观点。分析化石牙齿蛋白质的两篇研究发现，直立人拥有适应雨林环境的生存技能，这表明直立人可能具备与现代人相当的适应能力。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Nature"},"links":{"original":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03777-7"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T17:54:37.797Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T17:54:37.797Z","category":"life-science","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","Nature"],"score":37,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"b213f860-dd38-4886-9c9e-445e937a6518","title":"Nature提出直立人雨林生存新证据"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Ewen Callaway","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"b213f860-dd38-4886-9c9e-445e937a6518","title":"Nature提出直立人雨林生存新证据"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fj2lCh1TUh-o","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}